            <p class="security-lead">
              Downloading modified or re-uploaded files from third-party blogs, untrusted forums, or Discord servers is risky.<br />
              The executable provided on ErrorLedger is a clean, non-malicious standalone utility built with your security in mind.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="security-grid">
            <div class="sec-item">
              <div class="sec-icon">🔒</div>
              <div class="sec-content">
