              Download age-restricted broadcasts and clips securely using Naver session cookies.
            </p>
            <ul class="feature-list">
              <li>Enter your verified Naver cookies (<code>NID_AUT</code>, <code>NID_SES</code>) in Settings</li>
              <li>Bypass age-verification roadblocks safely</li>
              <li>Cookies remain stored strictly on your local PC</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="feature-card highlight-card">
