              <p>
                It is 100% safe. Microsoft Windows displays SmartScreen warnings for newly built executables that do not have expensive enterprise Extended Validation (EV) code-signing certificates. Simply click <strong>[More info] → [Run anyway]</strong>. You can verify the file integrity against our published SHA-256 hash (<code>{fileHash}</code>) anytime.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question">
              <span>Q. How do I download age-restricted (19+) broadcasts?</span>
              <span class="faq-arrow">▾</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                You need cookie credentials from an adult-verified Naver account (<code>NID_AUT</code> and <code>NID_SES</code>). Click the <strong>[Settings (Gear)]</strong> icon in the web UI, input your cookies, and you will be able to download restricted streams without issue. Cookies are stored locally on your machine only.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary class="faq-question">
              <span>Q. Why is the download speed so much faster than other sites?</span>
              <span class="faq-arrow">▾</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Conventional downloader services route video streams through third-party proxy servers to perform on-the-fly video transcoding. This program connects <strong>directly from your computer to Naver's high-speed CDN</strong>, utilizing your full internet bandwidth.
